{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Books Upon Books</strong></h2>A casual, simulation game in which you get to design, build upon, and upgrade your very own bookshop, before tending to it's customers during the day!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Building</h2>Spend your hard-earned money on buying up to 3 objects per day, unlocking new tiles and rearranging your shop.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Colour Palette</h2>Customise every detail of your shop, even down to the colours used. With 8 changeable colours used throughout, alter these to fit your style and make the shop your own.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999740/extras/Screenshot_2024-05-16_155307__Custom_.png?t=1743849068\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Serve Customers</h2>Customers will come in throughout the day, rummaging through the shelves before going to the counter to be served by you or your temporary hired staff, giving a number of coins.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999740/extras/Screenshot_2024-05-15_205347__Small_.png?t=1743849068\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Restock Shelves</h2>Once the customer has taken a book, the shelf will need to be restocked. You can see taken books by the red outline.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Money Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999740/25fe9848ce57318b7fb6ef94540e25edc96f8f3a.jpg"},{"name":"Open For Business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999740/1a235b19fa2f3d78855ea4e8ba5774b482f567ac.jpg"},{"name":"One Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999740/16c7e8ee07e85eba027799608d9f3954ffcf1903.jpg"},{"name":"Two Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999740/16c7e8ee07e85eba027799608d9f3954ffcf1903.jpg"},{"name":"Three Star","path":"https://cdn.a